The four AXI adapters are 60.2% of this design's logic and gmem0 alone is half of
it. The 3.66x against Gemmini is therefore mostly adapter mass, not compute: our
PE array is 21,188.50 um2 total (see the T4 reports), about 1.5% of this figure.
Whether Gemmini's StreamReader/StreamWriter/XactTracker carry comparable mass is
the open question; it cannot be answered from our side.
